### Schemas
Holds Pydantic models used for request body validation, response filtering, and interactive API documentation.
Remember to use VALID HTTP ERROR CODES!

## Expected Files
``schemaUser.py``     - User Schema
``schemaHotel.py``    - Hotel & Room Schama
``schemaBooking.py``  - Booking & Ticket Schema

